/-! ### The check

kcost (counted): `shiftLK` of the degree-400 polynomial (one Kronecker Horner shift, about 1 s in the cells);
171 `poleApx` (one `logQ` of order 12, at most one `argQ`, 8 complex powers `cpowQ`, 8 `dyRound`: about 500 rational
operations each, about 85500 in all); 14 plog terms (`shiftLK` of a list of 26, `poleApx` with 30 coefficients,
`pmulQ` of 26 by 31 terms: about 2000 operations each, about 28000); then `chebPolyUB` of the length-402 merged list:
`chebMono` of 72 terms (72 rounds of three list passes of length at most 74: about 5*72^2 = 25920
rational operations), `sclPow`, `vsubQ` and `absSum` of length 402 (about 1500 operations on rationals of 10 kbit).
Total about 160920 rational operations in ONE `decide +kernel`. -/

theorem chebDemoSn_check :
    chebMergePiece q1snFq 12 24 8 30 100 chebDemoSnLo chebDemoSnHi chebDemoSnPd chebDemoSnQd
      chebDemoSnGam q1snT = true := by
  decide +kernel

/-- the statement of the cells: the field is at most `q1snT` on the piece -/
theorem chebDemoSn_sound : ∀ x ∈ Icc ((chebDemoSnLo : ℚ) : ℝ) ((chebDemoSnHi : ℚ) : ℝ),
    fieldTower q1snFq (poleF q1snFq.poles) 0 x ≤ (q1snT : ℝ) :=
  chebMergePiece_sound q1snFq 12 24 8 30 100 chebDemoSnLo chebDemoSnHi chebDemoSnPd chebDemoSnQd
    chebDemoSnGam q1snT chebDemoSn_check

#print axioms chebDemoSn_check
#print axioms chebDemoSn_sound

end CatalanMeasure.GenD.Signed.Data.Cells
